<title>USA: TENNIS-MEN'S RESULTS IN SAN JOSE FRIDAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MEN'S RESULTS IN SAN JOSE FRIDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, California 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$303,000 Sybase Open tennis tournament on Friday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarterfinals:</p>
<p>7-Greg Rusedski (England) beat 2-Michael Chang (U.S.) 7-6 (7-4) 6-4</p>
<p>4-Todd Martin (U.S.) beat 6-Richey Reneberg (U.S.) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat 8-Chris Woodruff (U.S.) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>3- Andre Agassi (U.S.) beat Grant Doyle (Australia) 6-2 6-1</p>
</text>
